stem:
Using the bond enthalpy data below, calculate $\Delta H$ for the reaction:
$$2\text{H}_2(g) + \text{O}_2(g) \rightarrow 2\text{H}_2\text{O}(g)$$
\begin{align*}
E(\text{H--H}) &= 436\ \text{kJ mol}^{-1}\\
E(\text{O=O}) &= 498\ \text{kJ mol}^{-1}\\
E(\text{O--H}) &= 463\ \text{kJ mol}^{-1}
\end{align*}

